        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>3～6岁儿童学习与发展指南</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 25px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .top-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .top-bar .title {\n    width: 70%;\n  }\n  .stamp {\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 55px;\n    border: 1px dashed #c66;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #c66;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    transform: rotate(10deg);\n  }\n  .continued {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  th {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    padding: 8px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 14px 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  ol {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  ol > li {\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .bullets {\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .bullets li {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    text-indent: -1em;\n    padding-left: 1em;\n  }\n  .bullets li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .num-item {\n    text-indent: -1.4em;\n    padding-left: 1.4em;\n  }\n  mark.hl {\n    background: #ffe97a;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  span.ul {\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #f0a15a;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .margin-mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 4px;\n    color: #444;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"title\">3～6岁儿童学习与发展指南</div>\n    <div class=\"stamp\">[illegible<br>stamp]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"continued\">续表</div>\n\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>3~4岁</th>\n        <th>4~5岁</th>\n        <th>5~6岁</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>3. 在帮助下能较快适应集体生活。</td>\n        <td>3. 能较快适应人际环境中发生的变化，如换了新老师能较快适应。</td>\n        <td>3. 能较快融入新的人际关系环境。如换了新的幼儿园或班级能较快适应。</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">【教育建议】</div>\n\n  <ol>\n    <li class=\"num-item\">\n      1. 保证幼儿的<mark class=\"hl\">户外活动</mark>时间，提高幼儿适应<mark class=\"hl\">季节变化</mark>的能力。\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>幼儿每天的<mark class=\"hl\">户外活动</mark>时间一般<span class=\"ul\">不少于两小时</span>，其中体育活动时间<span class=\"ul\">不少于1小时</span>，季节交替时要坚持。</li>\n        <li>气温过热或过冷的季节或地区应因地制宜，选择温度<mark class=\"hl\">适当</mark>的时间段开展户外活动，也可根据气温的变化和幼儿的个体差异，<span class=\"ul\">适当减少活动的时间</span>。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"num-item\">\n      2. 经常与幼儿玩拉手转圈、秋千、转椅等游戏活动，让幼儿适应轻微的摆动、颠簸、旋转，促进其平衡机能的发展。\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"num-item\">\n      3. 锻炼幼儿适应生活环境变化的能力。如：\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>注意观察幼儿在新环境中的饮食、睡眠、游戏等</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"page-num\">·6·</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
